            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Chay Hỷ Lạc Quán",
            "review_text": "Chris I\nOakland, California99 contributions\n0\nGreat neighborhood vegetarian restaurant\nNov 2022 • Solo\nThis place may be hard to find. The address on the awning outside says 133/11. Google maps likes 11A Hoa Hung, Phuong 12, Quan 10. It's a long,, narrow slot inside with an active take out business around lunch time. Lots of neighbors come by and others passing on motorbikes. \nAll vegetarian food, simple, delicious, costing $1 to $2 US. They always refuse to accept tips. I often come here when I stay in HCMC. It's very friendly, both staff and customers. Multiple people have chatted with me as I sit here alone for lunch today. (With Google Translator) \nIt was quieter last night as it approached closing time around 8. I've liked this place every time I've come in since before the pandemic. \nThere are better photos of the food on Google Maps.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 16, 2022",
